# Build outputs
build/
probe/build/
*.apk
*.keystore

# Fetched or generated artefacts, all reproducible:
#   models/*.pt        -> huggingface.co/Arm/neural-super-sampling
#   models/*.onnx      -> tools/export_nss.py, quantize_nss.py, nhwc_io.py,
#                         prepare_style.py
#   models/*.f32,*.bin -> raw tensor dumps written by the tools and the harness
#   third_party/*.aar  -> repo1.maven.org, onnxruntime-android-qnn
#   third_party/gym    -> fetched by tools/export_nss.py
#   third_party/wine   -> wine headers from the Proton tree (see README)
models/*.pt
models/*.onnx
models/*.f32
models/*.bin
third_party/*.aar
third_party/gym/
third_party/wine/
third_party/ort-headers/
